1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,159
Okay the next item I got is the last thing I got from thick chick vintage.
好了，下一件是我从 Thick Chick Vintage 买的最后一样东西。

2
00:00:04,159 --> 00:00:09,040
And it's this paisley dress with bell sleeves.
就是这条带有佩斯利花纹和喇叭袖的连衣裙。

3
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:14,880
You know me okay if you know anything about my style you know that I cannot resist a bell sleeve.
了解我的人都知道，只要你对我的风格有一点了解，就知道我完全抗拒不了喇叭袖。

4
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,600
My arm cannot physically stretch out anymore.
我的手臂真的没办法再伸得更长了。

5
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:22,880
Um this dress is a bit long for my taste I do wish it was a little shorter.
嗯，这条裙子对我的喜好来说有点长，我真希望它能短一点。

6
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:27,519
And actually when I was talking to maddie who owns thick chick vintage when I was checking out.
实际上，我结账时和店主 Maddie 聊过这件事。

7
00:00:27,519 --> 00:00:31,680
She was also like I have this dress in purple I think.
她也说，她有同一条裙子的紫色款，我记得是紫色。

8
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:36,320
And she also wishes it was a little bit shorter so maybe there's something I can do about that.
她也希望裙子短一点，所以也许我可以想办法改一下。

9
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:39,590
But it's a really cute dress and it's not like anything I own.
但它真的很可爱，也和我已经有的衣服都不一样。

10
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,800
And even though I am trying to find light airy pieces for summer.
虽然我现在想找轻薄透气的夏季单品……

11
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:47,120
I do appreciate that this dress is really good for spring or autumn.
但我很喜欢它也适合春天或秋天穿。

12
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:52,159
And it's just versatile in that sense because I like versatile clothing.
从这个角度说它很百搭，我喜欢能灵活搭配、适用于不同场合的衣服。

13
00:00:52,159 --> 00:00:55,279
Maybe that fully developed prefrontal cortex does hit different.
也许完全成熟的前额叶真的让人不一样了。

14
00:00:55,279 --> 00:01:02,399
Because I actually want clothing that I will wear and that is wearable throughout multiple seasons.
因为我现在想要的是自己真的会穿、还能跨好几个季节穿的衣服。

15
00:01:02,399 --> 00:01:07,040
And not just statement pieces that I can only wear on like the hottest summer day.
而不是只有在最热的夏天才能穿的抢眼单品。

16
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:09,840
Okay the last two items are from a thrift store.
好，最后两件来自一家旧衣店。

17
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:20,720
And this next one might seem a bit shocking if you watch my videos just because I never really show myself wearing super baggy clothing or more masculine leaning clothes.
如果你看过我的视频，下一件可能会让你有点意外，因为我很少展示自己穿特别宽松、或者偏中性风格的衣服。

18
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:23,760
But I got this oversized blue ralph lauren t shirt.
不过我买了这件宽大的蓝色 Ralph Lauren T恤。

19
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,200
Because I tried it on at the thrift store and I just loved the fit of it.
因为我在旧衣店试穿后，特别喜欢它的版型和上身效果。

20
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:31,680
It was just so nice and baggy and it's just like the perfect top to throw on with some jeans.
它宽宽松松，刚好就是那种随手配一条牛仔裤的完美上衣。

21
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:36,880
And throw your hair up and just feel like cute in a casual way but also very comfortable.
再把头发扎起来，就会觉得自己随性又可爱，而且特别舒服。

22
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:41,440
Some of you may or may not find this shocking but I would say like 95 of the time.
这可能会让一些人意外，也可能不会，但我大概百分之九十五的时间……

23
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:44,480
I am wearing something that is baggy and comfortable.
穿的都是宽松舒服的衣服。

24
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:47,279
And bonus points if it's also a cute outfit.
如果同时还好看，那就更加分。

25
00:01:47,279 --> 00:01:54,399
The other 5 of the time I am wearing like a cute put together outfit that like I would put on instagram or something.
剩下百分之五的时间，才会穿那种精心搭好的漂亮衣服，可能拍照发到 Instagram 之类的地方。

26
00:01:54,399 --> 00:02:02,080
Because I am a normal person a regular person who is not always dressed for a cute outfit photo.
因为我也是普通人，又不是时时刻刻都为漂亮穿搭照打扮着。

27
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:03,440
I don't know why I went on that tangent.
我也不知道怎么突然扯到这里了。

28
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:07,200
But my point is is that this top is really comfortable and I enjoy it.
总之，我想说这件上衣真的很舒服，我很喜欢。

29
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:09,840
Okay most of you know by now that I also grew up fat.
好，大部分人应该已经知道，我从小就是胖胖的。

30
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:15,040
And something that I never really wore were shorts even though I grew up in miami.
我以前几乎不穿短裤，尽管我是在迈阿密长大的。

31
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:20,880
Raise your hand if you grew up in a subtropical hellscape mostly wearing skinny jeans leggings and hoodies.
如果你也在热得要命的亚热带地方长大，却基本只穿紧身牛仔裤、打底裤和连帽衫，请举手。

32
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:23,600
I have never really been a big shorts wearer.
我一直不太爱穿短裤。

33
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:25,509
I just find that they fit kind of awkward on me.
我就是觉得它们穿在我身上有点别扭。

34
00:02:25,519 --> 00:02:29,360
Because I do carry my waist and my stomach and they're not super comfortable.
因为我的体重主要集中在腰腹，所以短裤穿起来不太舒服。

35
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,279
And so I just never really reach for them.
所以我几乎不会主动拿起短裤来穿。

36
00:02:31,279 --> 00:02:35,440
Like if it's hot out I would lean more towards dresses or skirts.
如果天气热，我更倾向于穿连衣裙或者半身裙。

37
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:38,800
But I did find a pair of jords at the thrift store.
但我确实在旧衣店找到了一条牛仔短裤。

38
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:43,680
And while I love a good pair of jords I knew when I got these that I wanted to cut them.
虽然我很喜欢牛仔短裤，但买下这条时我就知道，自己想把它剪短。

39
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:47,440
And make them like more mini shorts and have a raw hem.
把它改成更短的短裤，留下毛边裤脚。

40
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:49,440
Which is how I ended up with these.
于是最后就变成了现在这样。

41
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:52,800
Can you guys see this better I do think I want to make these a smidge shorter.
你们这样看得清些吗？我觉得还想再剪短一点点。

42
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:55,840
I know they look kind of short but you'll see what I mean when I put them on.
我知道看着已经有点短了，但等我穿上，你们就明白我的意思。

43
00:02:55,840 --> 00:03:02,790
And these are just the perfect denim wash that I imagined when I was looking for a pair of raw hem shorts.
这正是我找毛边短裤时，脑海里想象的那种牛仔水洗色。

44
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:05,030
And once again these are venezia brand.
而且这条又是 Venezia 这个牌子的。

45
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:11,200
Beneia is one of my favorite brands to look for when I'm thrifting searching on depot ebay poshmark etc.
我淘衣，或者在字幕所说的 depot、eBay、Poshmark 等平台搜索时，总爱找这个牌子。

46
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:14,320
I went to the ravenswood garage sale a few days ago.
前几天我去过 Ravenswood 的车库旧物出售活动。

47
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:18,399
And I am so upset because I saw this vintage venzia cardigan.
现在想起来很懊恼，因为我当时看到一件这个牌子的复古开衫。

48
00:03:18,399 --> 00:03:22,080
It was like green with polka dots on it and I really wish I got it.
它是绿色带波点的，我真希望当时买了。

49
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,680
But I second guessed myself.
但我又开始怀疑自己的决定。

50
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:26,800
And I was like I don't need a cardigan right now and I didn't get it.
我想，现在不需要开衫，于是就没买。

51
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:30,070
But if you're plus size definitely keep an eye out for bisia.
不过，如果你穿大码，可以留意一下这个牌子。

52
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:35,000
Not everything is super cute obviously there's hit or misses but a lot of them are hits.
当然，不是每件都可爱，总有好有坏，但也确实有不少好东西。
